01:17:30.572 --> 01:17:32.972
redevelopment of the western

01:17:32.975 --> 01:17:33.709
tradition.

01:17:33.709 --> 01:17:34.476
>> while his musical influence

01:17:34.476 --> 01:17:36.878
can be felt across the world,

01:17:36.878 --> 01:17:37.479
he was a thorough through and

01:17:37.479 --> 01:17:39.479
through san franciscan.

01:17:39.948 --> 01:17:40.649
>> his love for the city

01:17:40.649 --> 01:17:41.416
inspired his music and he was

01:17:41.416 --> 01:17:44.186
proud to hail from georgetown

01:17:44.186 --> 01:17:44.919
and the fillmore.

01:17:44.919 --> 01:17:47.823
He served as director of the

01:17:47.823 --> 01:17:48.524
san francisco asian american

01:17:48.524 --> 01:17:49.258
jazz festival helping cement

01:17:49.258 --> 01:17:51.960
the city's place at the heart

01:17:51.960 --> 01:17:52.728
of the genre.

01:17:52.728 --> 01:17:55.164
He was also generous with his

01:17:55.164 --> 01:17:55.964
time to the japantown community

01:17:55.964 --> 01:17:56.732
