01:17:56.732 --> 01:17:59.134
and contributing artists to the

01:17:59.134 --> 01:17:59.868
japantown cultural district and

01:17:59.868 --> 01:18:02.868
teaching third graders at rosa

01:18:03.400 --> 01:18:03.905
parks elementary school.

01:18:03.905 --> 01:18:07.343
>> I first met mark and brenda

01:18:07.343 --> 01:18:07.843
at the cherry blossom festival

01:18:07.843 --> 01:18:08.644
parade last year.

01:18:08.644 --> 01:18:11.647
They MARCH every year with the

01:18:11.647 --> 01:18:12.248
japanese american religious

01:18:12.248 --> 01:18:14.248
federation or giraffe.

01:18:15.384 --> 01:18:16.840
>> a coalition of christian,

01:18:16.840 --> 01:18:18.484
buddhist and shinto spiritual

01:18:19.210 --> 01:18:21.858
leaders j r f began in the

01:18:21.858 --> 01:18:22.525
japanese prison camps because

01:18:22.525 --> 01:18:23.226
in realizing the challenging

01:18:23.226 --> 01:18:26.226
nature of the times spiritual

01:18:26.295 --> 01:18:26.863
leaders concluded it was better

01:18:26.863 --> 01:18:29.263
to all work together.

01:18:30.199 --> 01:18:30.866
>> the darkness of those times

01:18:30.866 --> 01:18:32.866
was reflected meaningfully

01:18:34.300 --> 01:18:34.703
in mark's music as its theme is

01:18:34.703 --> 01:18:35.471
recognize not only the deep

01:18:35.471 --> 01:18:37.740
history and trauma of the time

01:18:37.740 --> 01:18:38.340
but celebrates and honors the

01:18:38.340 --> 01:18:40.340
