01:18:41.544 --> 01:18:42.245
triumphant spirit of the

01:18:42.245 --> 01:18:44.245
japanese-american community.

01:18:45.548 --> 01:18:46.315
Mark is survived by his wife

01:18:46.315 --> 01:18:46.849
and frequent artistic and life

01:18:46.849 --> 01:18:48.849
collaborator brenda.

01:18:49.285 --> 01:18:51.821
Their son K.K. And

01:18:51.821 --> 01:18:52.188
