01:18:52.188 --> 01:18:52.922
brothers.

01:18:52.922 --> 01:18:55.922
>> rest in peace marcie xue.

01:18:56.292 --> 01:18:56.725
MAY your memory be a blessing.

01:18:56.725 --> 01:18:57.127
>> thank you.

